{
	31_19: {
		cardInfo: {
			image: hobbit/HDG3119.jpg
			collInfo: 31_19
			rarity: _
		}
		title: Better Than Nothing
		unique: true
		side: shadow
		culture: gollum
		twilight: 0
		type: condition
		keywords: support area
		effects: [
			{
				type: modifier
				modifier: {
					type: extraCostToPlay
					filter: culture(gandalf),event
					requires: {
						type: canSpot
						filter: name(Gollum)
					}
					cost: {
						type: addBurdens
						amount: 1
					}
				}
			}
			{
				type: Trigger
				optional: true
				trigger: {
					type: endOfPhase
					phase: shadow
				}
				cost: {
					type: discard
					select: choose(orc)
				}
				effect: {
					type: choice
					texts: [
						Play Gollum from your draw deck
						Play Gollum from your discard pile
					]
					effects: [
						{
							type: playCardFromDrawDeck
							select: choose(name(Gollum))
							showAll: true
							shuffle: true
							mustExist: true
						}
						{
							type: playCardFromDiscard
							select: choose(name(Gollum))
						}
					]
				}
			}
		]
		gametext: While you can spot Gollum, each [gandalf] event gains this cost: "add a doubt."<br>At the end of your Shadow phase, you may discard an Orc from play to play Gollum from your draw deck or discard pile.
		lore: "'Nasty goblinses are better than old bones, precious. Better than nothing!'"
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}

	31_20: {
		cardInfo: {
			image: hobbit/HDG3120.jpg
			collInfo: 31_20
			rarity: _
		}
		title: Gollum
		subtitle: Small Slimy Creature
		unique: true
		side: shadow
		culture: gollum
		twilight: 2
		type: minion
		strength: 5
		vitality: 4
		site: 4
		effects: [
			{
				type: Trigger
				optional: true
				trigger: {
					type: winsSkirmish
					filter: self
				}
				effect: {
					type: addBurdens
					amount: 1
				}
			}
			{
				type: activated
				phase: assignment
				requires: {
					type: canspot
					filter: self,assignableToSkirmishAgainst(name(Bilbo))
				}
				cost: [
					{
						type: exert
						select: choose(self,not(roaming))
					}
				]
				effect: [
					{
						type: assignFpCharacterToSkirmish
						fpCharacter: choose(name(Bilbo))
						minion: self
					}
					{
						type: modifyStrength
						select: self
						amount: {
							type: Conditional
							requires: {
								type: location
								filter: underground
							}
							true: 3
							false: 1
						}
						until: start(regroup)
					}
				]
			}
		]
		gametext: Each time Gollum wins a skirmish, you may add a doubt.<br><b>Assignment:</b> If Gollum is not roaming, exert Gollum and assign him to Bilbo to make Gollum strength +1 (or +3 at an underground site) until the regroup phase.
		lore: "'Games?! Oh, we love games, doesn't we, precious?'"
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}

	31_21: {
		cardInfo: {
			image: hobbit/HDG3121.jpg
			collInfo: 31_21
			rarity: _
		}
		title: If He Loses
		unique: false
		side: shadow
		culture: gollum
		twilight: 2
		type: event
		timewords: skirmish
		effects: [
			{
				type: activatedInDiscard
				phase: skirmish
				cost: {
					type: exert
					select: choose(name(Gollum))
					times: 2
				}
				effect: {
					type: playCardFromDiscard
					select: self
				}
			}
			{
				type: event
				effect: [
					{
						type: modifyStrength
						select: choose(minion)
						amount: 2
						memorize: chosenMinion
					}
					{
						type: addTrigger
						optional: true
						trigger: {
							type: winsSkirmish
							filter: memory(chosenMinion)
						}
						effect: {
							type: addBurdens
							amount: 1
						}
					}
				]
			}
		]
		gametext: You may exert Gollum twice to play this event from your discard pile.<br>Make a minion strength +2. If this minion wins this skirmish, you may add a doubt.
		lore: "'And if it loses, what then? Well, if it loses, precious, then we eats it!'"
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}

	31_22: {
		cardInfo: {
			image: hobbit/HDG3122.jpg
			collInfo: 31_22
			rarity: _
		}
		title: Riddles in the Dark
		unique: true
		side: shadow
		culture: gollum
		twilight: 2
		type: condition
		keywords: support area
		effects: [
			{
				type: Trigger
				optional: false
				trigger: {
					type: moves
				}
				effect: {
					type: addTwilight
					amount: 2
				}
			}
			{
				type: Response
				trigger: [
					{
						type: exerted
						filter: name(Bilbo)
					}
					{
						type: takesWound
						filter: name(Bilbo)
					}
				]
				cost: [
					{
						type: exert
						select: choose(minion)
					}
					{
						type: discardFromHand
						forced: false
					}
				]
				effect: {
					type: preventable
					player: fp
					text: Would you like to discard 2 cards from hand to prevent discarding a SHIRE card?
					cost: {
						type: discardFromHand
						count: 2
						forced: false
					}
					effect: {
						type: discard
						select: choose(culture(shire),not(name(Bilbo)))
					}
				}
			}
		]
		gametext: Each time the fellowship moves, add (2).<br><b>Response:</b> If Bilbo exerts or takes a wound, exert a minion and discard a card from hand to discard a [shire] card (except Bilbo). The Free Peoples player may discard 2 cards from hand to prevent this.
		lore: "'It like riddles, praps it does, does it?'"
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
